# Build outputs and CI scratch files, all written next to the sources: the
# devctl Makefile's mcp-prometheus-v<version>-<os>-<arch> and bin-dist/, the
# architect CI's .ldflags, .platforms and mcp-prometheus-<os>-<arch> (six of
# them, built concurrently). Untracked, any of these flips Go's VCS stamp to
# vcs.modified=true and the binaries built after it report vX.Y.Z+dirty
# (pkg/project reads that stamp when no version ldflag is injected).
/mcp-prometheus
/mcp-prometheus-*
/bin-dist/
.ldflags
.platforms
dist/

# Configuration files
.mcp-prometheus/config.yaml
.cursor/mcp.json

# Go specific
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# mcp-prometheus  # Removed this line - it was too broad and ignored the helm chart

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

